{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 as a persistent passive FTP destination using Xenial-compatible vsftpd 3.0.3. The scanner account is non-login, chroot-confined, and writable only inside its dropbox. Passive upload/retrieval, sample integrity, anonymous denial, confinement, and recovery after sequential node restarts were verified.","actions_performed":["Installed and enabled vsftpd on node1 without changing the operating-system release or kernel.","Created the scanner account from the staged handover with a root-owned chroot and scanner-owned dropbox.","Configured passive ports 30000–30009 and disabled anonymous FTP.","Uploaded and retrieved the supplied sample scan from node2 with matching SHA-256 hashes.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified changed boot identities and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Legacy-compatible FTP service while retaining OS and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-6f7ea2b024994caa","cmd-1ac9a38dfb3247c1","cmd-0906b5df2fb74eee"],"summary":"Installed Xenial vsftpd 3.0.3-3ubuntu2; both nodes remained Ubuntu 16.04.7 with kernel 4.4.0-210 after restart."},{"requirement":"Scanner account can passively upload and retrieve the supplied sample","command_ids":["cmd-b13ff22bd1bc4c36","cmd-4f56b0c5711a4a7e"],"summary":"PASV negotiated ports 30008 and 30007; STOR and RETR succeeded and the retrieved scan matched byte-for-byte."},{"requirement":"Scanner is confined to its dedicated dropbox","command_ids":["cmd-dc956479076d4c97","cmd-53bdf044a7a24a90","cmd-cae4513af5704d04"],"summary":"Traversal toward host /etc/passwd failed, root-level upload was denied with FTP 553, and the final root-owned chroot/dropbox permissions were confirmed."},{"requirement":"Anonymous access unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-e7fd18f1554840af"],"summary":"Anonymous authentication was rejected with FTP 530."},{"requirement":"node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c4814c949cb44883","cmd-014b2ef121ab4053","cmd-645b65661a144356","cmd-1ac9a38dfb3247c1","cmd-b96f0392f5bb4132"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgment, changed boot ID, recovered enabled listener and persistent file hashes, plus successful remote retrieval."},{"requirement":"node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-10d8df4e0ebe4291","cmd-659c973ebd0f49d2","cmd-8ffd2a667b774394","cmd-0906b5df2fb74eee"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgment, changed boot ID, persistent source data, and a successful post-restart passive upload/retrieval round trip."}]}
